  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Collaborative on Development Sciences (UKCDS) Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the relevance and maximise the impact of UK research funding on the lives of the world&apos;s poorest people.  The UK Collaborative on Development Sciences (UKCDS) will provide a framework for a more co-ordinated approach to development sciences research by UK based funders and stakeholders in international development research.</narrative>
  </description>
